Hazardous Seas Watch, very steep and hazardous seas 12 to 15 ft
at 14 seconds and south winds 20 to 30 kt possible.

* WHERE...Outer Coastal Waters from Cape Shoalwater to Florence
10 to 60 NM offshore.

* WHEN...Small Craft Advisory, until 4 AM PST Sunday. Hazardous
Seas Watch, from late tonight through Sunday evening.

